($$cddf4683-e17e-4ee1-9176-fd06950516b7$$,$$Sö 171$$,$$B 816|L 865$$,58.8887,17.2532,$$(i)nk(i)f(a)[s]tr · l[i](t) (h)(a)ku… st(a)…n · eftiʀ · sihuiþ · faþ-r · si[n · han · fial · i h]ul(m)[karþi · skaiþaʀ · uisi mi]þ · ski…ra$$,$$"Ingifastr lét hǫggv[a] ste[i]n eptir "Sigvið, fǫð[u]r sinn. Hann fell í "Holmgarði, skeiðar vísi með ski[pa]ra.$$,$$Ingefast lät hugga stenen efter Sigvid, sin fader. Han föll i Holmgård, skeppshövdingen, med skeppsfolket.$$,$$Ingifastr had the stone cut in memory of Sigviðr, his father. He fell in Holmgarðr, the ship's leader with the seamen.$$,NULL,$$Brate anger Säterstads sn$$,$$Jordfast stenblock$$,$$Diorit$$,$$Södermanland$$,$$Sweden$$),
($$0e01f10a-feae-413c-a96b-e8fb07e12229$$,$$Sö 159$$,NULL,58.8675,17.0411,$$: ikialtr : ak : aluiʀ : raisþu : stain : þansi : at : þurbiurn : faþur : sin : han uaistr hafʀ/(a)fʀ uf/(u)f uaʀit leki ¶ rorikʀ · kumytr biu · kunlaifʀ hiuk ru-aʀ$$,$$"Ingjaldr ok "Ǫlvir reistu stein þenna at "Þorbjǫrn, fǫður sinn. Hann vestr hefir of verit lengi. "Hrœríkr(?), "Guðmundr(?), "<biu>. "Gunnleifr hjogg rú[n]ar.$$,$$Ingjald och Alver/Ölver reste denna sten efter Torbjörn, sin fader. Han har länge varit västerut. Rörik(?),Gudmund(?), <biu>. Gunnlev högg runorna.$$,$$Ingjaldr and Ǫlvir raised this stone in memory of Þorbjǫrn, their father. He has been long in the west. Hrœríkr(?), Guðmundr(?), <biu>. Gunnleifr cut the runes.$$,NULL,NULL,$$Runsten$$,$$Granit$$,$$Södermanland$$,$$Sweden$$),
