($$7924833b-2078-4b63-8e68-6f749c578d4a$$,$$Sö 248$$,$$B 675|L 833$$,58.9485,17.8959,$$: a[n]… … …fʀ · auk · þorstain · auk un : þaiʀ · lit[u] at · þius[tu]… …[þ]ur sin$$,$$"An[undr](?) [ok "Olæi]fʀ(?) ok "Þorstæinn ok "Unn, þæiʀ letu at "Þiustu[lf, fa]ður sinn.$$,$$Anund(?) [och] Olev(?) och Torsten och Un, de lät (hugga hällen) efter Tjustulv, sin fader.$$,$$Ǫnundr(?) and Óleifr(?) and Þorsteinn and Unn, they had (the rock-slab cut) in memory of Þjóstulfr, their father.$$,NULL,NULL,$$Jordfast stenblock$$,$$Sten$$,$$Södermanland$$,$$Sweden$$),
($$37c2a149-e469-4080-b758-8ffe5f09b6ab$$,$$Sö 307$$,$$B 831|L 796$$,59.1917,17.6163,$$ul(f)hiþin · auk : au… … …aiʀ : raistu : stai(n) : þinsa : at : þurstin : faþur : sin :$$,$$"Ulfheðinn ok "… … [þ]eir reistu stein þenna at "Þorstein, fǫður sinn.$$,$$Ulvheden och … de reste denna sten efter Torsten, sin fader.$$,$$Ulfheðinn and … they raised this stone in memory of Þorsteinn, their father.$$,NULL,$$Igelsta ligger i Östertälje sn.$$,$$Runsten$$,$$Gråsten$$,$$Södermanland$$,$$Sweden$$),
